visentin@mundil.cs.mu.OZ.AU (Michael Alfred VISENTIN) writes:

>A few newbie type questions ...
>1. What do you do with statues and figurines ??

If you break a statue with a pick-axe or a wand of striking/digging, you
MIGHT find a spellbook. If you apply a figurine, you get a pet.

>2. Is it OK to eat a unicorn corpse?

Yes, if it is not your own alignment. (white for lawful, gray for neutral,
black for chaotic)

