>   dungeon level 10 and then do them; is it best to quaff every 
>   potion and read every scroll you get etc...

Your own choice. I never go to the mines when I find the entrance, I always
gather some experience and better armor/weapons.. usually until dlevel 14
or something like that. I quaff all the unknown potions as soon as I find them
(unless I know they are cursed). 
